" relative links to the corresponding tag. Paths, features, validation results, and known "
"limitations refer to that historical version, not current status or renewed acceptance testing."

msgid "发布范围"
msgstr "Release scope"

msgid ""
"上一版本基线：``5.0.0`` 的版本提交 `6894edc64ba663193ec9139732e704f93b0d0b24 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/commit/6894edc64ba663193ec9139732e704f93b0d0b24>`__。"
msgstr ""
"Previous baseline: version commit `6894edc64ba663193ec9139732e704f93b0d0b24 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/commit/6894edc64ba663193ec9139732e704f93b0d0b24>`__ "
"for ``5.0.0``."

msgid ""
"本次版本：``5.1.0``，终点为 `v5.1.0 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/tree/v5.1.0>`__ 指向的版本提交。"
msgstr ""
"Current version: ``5.1.0``, ending at the version commit referenced by `v5.1.0 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/tree/v5.1.0>`__."

msgid ""
"统计区间为 ``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]``：起点不含、终点包含。仅总结 ReliefOS 主仓自身源码、应用、系统配置、构建、测试与文档；不包含 ReliefNT 实现或纯内核 "
"gitlink 更新。"
msgstr ""
"The range is ``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]``: exclusive of the start, inclusive of the end. This summary "
"covers only ReliefOS repository sources, applications, system configuration, builds, tests, and "
"documentation, excluding ReliefNT implementations and kernel-gitlink-only updates."

msgid "这是正式源码 Release；未上传二进制镜像或 SDK，不表示整版运行验收完成。"
msgstr ""
"This is a stable source release. No binary images or SDK were uploaded, and full-version runtime "
"acceptance is not implied."

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid "桌面、登录与图形应用"
msgstr "Desktop, login, and graphical applications"

msgid ""
"引入 Xorg 桌面后端、锁定 Alpine Xorg/XDM 依赖闭包，先完成 TWM 会话，再迁移至当前 IceWM 桌面；增加后端选择、配置、会话生命周期诊断、异常退出恢复和 VT "
"契约探针。"
msgstr ""
"Introduced an Xorg desktop backend and pinned the Alpine Xorg/XDM dependency closure, first "
"delivering TWM sessions and then migrating to the current IceWM desktop. Added backend selection, "
"configuration, session-lifecycle diagnostics, abnormal-exit recovery, and VT contract probes."

msgid ""
"XDM 恢复标准配置文件和上游风格 greeter，整理服务器、会话与背景脚本；修复输入焦点和诊断事件读取，减少从登录到 IceWM 会话启动的等待。配置由独立签名包管理，避免改写上游 APK。"
msgstr ""
"XDM restores standard configuration files and an upstream-style greeter, reorganizes server, "
"session, and background scripts, fixes input focus and diagnostic-event reads, and reduces the "
"wait from login to IceWM session startup. Separate signed packages manage configuration without "
"rewriting upstream APKs."

msgid ""
"IceWM 提供随包主题、背景、任务栏、快捷键和标准应用分类；恢复开始菜单分类生成，保持用户个人配置优先。默认终端由 xterm 切换为 st，提供 NEdit 文本编辑器和 Dillo "
"浏览器。PCManFM 曾试用后移除，不是本版交付组件。"
msgstr ""
"IceWM includes packaged themes, backgrounds, taskbar, shortcuts, and standard application "
"categories. Start-menu category generation is restored, with user configuration taking precedence."
" The default terminal changes from xterm to st; NEdit and Dillo are provided. PCManFM was tried "
"and removed and is not delivered in this release."

msgid ""
"12 个自有 X11 前端最终迁至 C++17 / FLTK 1.3.11：计算器、系统信息、文件管理器、任务管理器、扫雷、两款图片应用、画图、图片查看器、Doom launcher、Doom "
"平台前端和安装器。中间的 Motif 前端已被替代；第三方 NEdit 仍保留自身 Motif 依赖。"
msgstr ""
"Twelve in-house X11 frontends ultimately migrate to C++17 / FLTK 1.3.11: calculator, system "
"information, file manager, task manager, Minesweeper, two image applications, Paint, image viewer,"
" Doom launcher, Doom platform frontend, and installer. Intermediate Motif frontends have been "
"replaced; third-party NEdit retains its own Motif dependency."

msgid ""
"统一 FLTK 公共初始化、UTF-8 / gettext、中文字体、原生文件选择器翻译及目标 C++ "
"运行库；增加过长路径拒绝、外部文件名显示保护、焦点和文件操作回归。计算器提供整数表达式与错误检查；系统信息保留内核调试器入口；画图和查看器支持 BMP/PNG。"
msgstr ""
"Unified shared FLTK initialization, UTF-8/gettext, Chinese fonts, native file-chooser "
"translations, and target C++ runtime. Added rejection of overlong paths, safe external-filename "
"display, and focus/file-operation regressions. The calculator offers integer expressions and error"
" checks; system information retains the kernel-debugger entry; Paint and the viewer support "
"BMP/PNG."

msgid ""
"Fileman 增加名称搜索和定位、地址与目录导航、多选、复制剪切粘贴、压缩解压和权限属性；重排工具区域与分栏。删除采用确认后的直接删除，没有回收站恢复。Task Manager "
"重排进程、性能和启动项页面；保留进程树、详情、终止确认及 CPU/内存/GPU 图表。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman adds name search/location, address and directory navigation, multiselection, "
"copy/cut/paste, archive extraction/creation, and permission properties, with reorganized tools and"
" panes. Deletion is direct after confirmation, with no trash recovery. Task Manager reorganizes "
"process, performance, and startup pages while retaining process trees, details, termination "
"confirmation, and CPU/memory/GPU charts."

msgid ""
"自有图形应用统一标准 hicolor 图标、桌面文件和文件打开关联；修复 Xorg 用户态适配中的 VMware 绝对鼠标坐标同步与 SVGA 配置问题。上述修复不等同于本版 VMware "
"完整验收。"
msgstr ""
"In-house graphical applications use standard hicolor icons, desktop files, and file associations. "
"VMware absolute-mouse coordinate synchronization and SVGA configuration issues in Xorg userspace "
"integration are fixed; these fixes do not constitute complete VMware acceptance for this release."

msgid ""
"修复第三方 GTK 程序的图片解码、图标主题及用户目录配置：补齐 glycin 图片/SVG loader、hicolor/Adwaita 图标主题及 GTK 默认主题设置，在会话客户端启动前创建"
" XDG 用户目录；增加 GTK 窗口与警告信息的运行检查工具。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed image decoding, icon themes, and user-directory configuration for third-party GTK programs: "
"added glycin image/SVG loaders, hicolor/Adwaita themes, and GTK default-theme settings, creating "
"XDG user directories before session clients start. Added runtime tools for GTK windows and "
"warnings."

msgid "办公与包管理"
msgstr "Office applications and package management"

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefExcel**：多工作表、公式栏、相对/绝对及跨表引用、常用公式、样式、合并、填充、排序筛选、查找替换、冻结和缩放；支持原生 ``.rexl``、UTF-8 "
"CSV、模板、原子保存、外部修改检测和定时恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefExcel**: multiple sheets, formula bar, relative/absolute and cross-sheet references,"
" common formulas, styles, merging, fill, sort/filter, find/replace, freezing, and zoom. Supports "
"native ``.rexl``, UTF-8 CSV, templates, atomic saves, external-change detection, and periodic "
"recovery."

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefWord**：中文分页编辑、字符与段落样式、列表、页面尺寸和页边距、页眉页脚页码、标尺、缩放、查找替换及撤销重做；支持原生 ``.rword``、TXT/HTML "
"子集导入导出、原子保存、冲突检测和恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefWord**: paginated Chinese editing, character/paragraph styles, lists, page "
"size/margins, headers/footers/page numbers, ruler, zoom, find/replace, and undo/redo. Supports "
"native ``.rword``, TXT/HTML-subset import/export, atomic saves, conflict detection, and recovery."

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefPPT**：幻灯片版式、文字与嵌入图片、基础形状、多对象移动缩放/对齐/图层、背景和网格、演讲备注及全屏放映；支持原生 ``.rppt``、PNG/离线 HTML "
"分享、原子保存、外部修改检测和恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefPPT**: slide layouts, text/embedded images, basic shapes, multiobject "
"movement/resizing/alignment/layering, backgrounds/grids, speaker notes, and full-screen "
"slideshows. Supports native ``.rppt``, PNG/offline-HTML sharing, atomic saves, external-change "
"detection, and recovery."

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefAPK**：通过真实 apk 命令浏览、搜索和查看软件包、依赖、文件与来源；支持安装、卸载、升级、重装、修复、本地 "
"APK、操作队列和执行前模拟。提供软件源编辑与备份/冲突检测、缓存/密钥/审计等工具、设置和普通用户密码提权；后台子进程避免长操作阻塞主界面。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefAPK**: uses real apk commands to browse/search packages and inspect dependencies, "
"files, and sources. Supports install, remove, upgrade, reinstall, repair, local APKs, operation "
"queues, and pre-execution simulation. Includes repository editing with backups/conflict detection,"
" cache/key/audit tools, settings, and normal-user password elevation. Background subprocesses keep"
" long operations from blocking the UI."

msgid ""
"加入 **ReliefMail 开发源码** 及模型/协议/存储/界面测试工具，包含 SMTP/IMAP、多账户、邮件编辑、附件与主密码保险库等实现。本提交范围结束时，尚未接入默认组件清单和主仓 "
"FLTK 应用构建列表，不能视为默认镜像中已经可用的完整邮件客户端。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefMail development sources** and model/protocol/storage/UI test tools, including "
"SMTP/IMAP, multiple accounts, composition, attachments, and a master-password vault. At the end of"
" this commit range it was not wired into the default component manifest or FLTK build list, so it "
"is not a complete mail client available in the default image."

msgid "终端、工具与依赖"
msgstr "Terminals, tools, and dependencies"

msgid ""
"默认交互 shell 切换为官方 Alpine Bash，提供账户 shell 迁移辅助程序，保留 BusyBox ash 的 ``/bin/sh``；交互 Bash 配置加入 "
"fastfetch。"
msgstr ""
"The default interactive shell changes to official Alpine Bash, with an account-shell migration "
"helper. BusyBox ash remains ``/bin/sh``; interactive Bash configuration includes fastfetch."

msgid ""
"扩展 BusyBox 工具与包文件归属检查，用标准 ping 替代退役图形 Ping；移除旧 cmd 子模块和构建接线。引入 GNU coreutils 的 "
"dd/yes，并补充管道、并发、错误路径和吞吐测量工具；这些是主仓工具及验证变化，内核管道实现见 ReliefNT Release。"
msgstr ""
"Expanded BusyBox tools and package-file ownership checks, replaced retired graphical Ping with "
"standard ping, and removed the old cmd submodule/build wiring. Added GNU coreutils dd/yes and "
"tools for pipes, concurrency, error paths, and throughput measurement. These are repository "
"tools/validation changes; kernel pipe implementations are in the ReliefNT Release."

msgid "新增 ``driverinfo`` 控制台工具，提供驱动状态与种类信息展示。"
msgstr "Added the ``driverinfo`` console tool to display driver status and categories."

msgid "mbedTLS 从 2.28.8 升至 3.6.7，调整配置、构建和目标 TLS 适配；保留证书和主机名校验，增加相关验证记录。"
msgstr ""
"Upgraded mbedTLS from 2.28.8 to 3.6.7, adapting configuration, builds, and target TLS support. "
"Certificate/hostname verification remains enabled, with additional validation records."

msgid "音频、安装与系统集成"
msgstr "Audio, installation, and system integration"

msgid ""
"增加 ALSA、ALSA 工具、Nuked OPL3、音频运行库、音量控制及音频服务的独立构建和 rootfs/SDK 集成；扩充音频设置与 Doom "
"输出、混音及音乐适配，归档主机和历史虚拟机证据。声卡与 PCM 内核实现属于 ReliefNT，不在此说明重复。"
msgstr ""
"Added independent builds and rootfs/SDK integration for ALSA, ALSA tools, Nuked OPL3, audio "
"runtime, volume controls, and audio services. Expanded audio settings, Doom output, mixing, and "
"music adaptation, archiving host and historical VM evidence. Sound-card and PCM kernel "
"implementations belong to ReliefNT and are not repeated here."

msgid "安装器从旧桌面协议转为当前 FLTK X11 前端，保留 TTY 安装路径；改进磁盘控制工具，移除主题选择步骤，提供是否安装 Xorg 桌面的选择，支持桌面和纯控制台目标配置。"
msgstr ""
"The installer moves from the old desktop protocol to the current FLTK X11 frontend while retaining"
" TTY installation. Disk-control tools improve, theme selection is removed, and an Xorg-desktop "
"installation choice supports desktop and console-only target configurations."

msgid ""
"系统镜像、GRUB、安装器和更新脚本改为直接装配/启动 ``kernel.sys``，移除 ``loader.elf`` 及 ``.drv`` 产物的父仓接线、包装和启动路径；不再依赖旧 "
"windowd 服务入口。Doom/launcher 不再进入默认镜像，仍可按组件选择构建。"
msgstr ""
"System images, GRUB, installer, and update scripts assemble/boot ``kernel.sys`` directly, removing"
" parent-repository wiring, wrappers, and boot paths for ``loader.elf`` and ``.drv`` artifacts. The"
" old windowd service is no longer required. Doom/launcher leave the default image but remain "
"selectable build components."

msgid ""
"增补启动控制台的 Linux TTY 用户态契约和 FD/VT/termios 回归，覆盖 OpenRC、PTY、evdev 与关闭标志相关场景；内核实现另见 ReliefNT Release。"
msgstr ""
"Added boot-console Linux TTY userspace contracts and FD/VT/termios regressions covering OpenRC, "
"PTY, evdev, and close-flag scenarios. See the ReliefNT Release for kernel implementations."

msgid "根文件系统的 ``VERSION_ID`` 与本仓发布版本统一，避免继续报告历史 4.x 身份。"
msgstr ""
"Root-filesystem ``VERSION_ID`` now matches this repository's release version instead of reporting "
"the historical 4.x identity."

msgid "构建、测试与文档"
msgstr "Builds, tests, and documentation"

msgid ""
"增加 ``make fetch-check`` 对锁定依赖 URL 的探测，更新 sessreg 校验值、Xorg server 索引和 coreutils 下载镜像；FLTK "
"开发头/链接库由锁定且验证过的目标 APK 提供，避免引入宿主 glibc C++ 依赖。"
msgstr ""
"Added ``make fetch-check`` to probe pinned dependency URLs; updated the sessreg checksum, Xorg "
"server index, and coreutils download mirror. FLTK development headers/link libraries come from "
"pinned, verified target APKs, avoiding host glibc C++ dependencies."

msgid "修正 APK trigger 的 chroot 执行环境与 CI 非特权 userns 设置，强化签名、ownership、组件选择、目标依赖闭包、SDK、NLS 和桌面入口检查。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed APK-trigger chroot execution and CI unprivileged-userns settings; strengthened signature, "
"ownership, component selection, target dependency closure, SDK, NLS, and desktop-entry checks."

msgid "为内核目录重排同步主仓测试夹具/头文件路径，补充 OPOST、内存映射、vDSO、调度、事件唤醒、吞吐和控制台的用户态回归与分层证据；不把这些测试接线当作主仓实现了内核功能。"
msgstr ""
"Updated parent test-fixture/header paths for kernel-directory reorganization and added userspace "
"regressions/layered evidence for OPOST, memory mappings, vDSO, scheduling, event wakeups, "
"throughput, and consoles. Test wiring is not claimed as kernel functionality implemented in this "
"repository."

msgid ""
"更新 Xorg、音频、FLTK、办公应用、ABI/系统调用和验证文档；Pages 避免链接未发布的内部文档。新增长期发布规范，固定版本提交区间、两仓职责、迁移说明、验证披露与 GitHub CLI"
" 发布流程。"
msgstr ""
"Updated Xorg, audio, FLTK, office-app, ABI/syscall, and validation documentation. Pages avoids "
"unpublished internal-document links. Added a lasting release policy defining version-commit "
"ranges, repository responsibilities, migration notes, validation disclosures, and the GitHub CLI "
"release workflow."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid "**是。** 本区间包含以下迁移影响，不能仅根据 ``5.1.0`` 的小版本形式判断兼容性："
msgstr ""
"**Yes.** This range has the following migration impacts; the minor-version form of ``5.1.0`` alone"
" does not establish compatibility:"

msgid "桌面和安装器使用 Xorg/FLTK，旧 windowd 客户端、服务入口和专属配置不能直接作为新会话配置。XDM/IceWM 应使用各自标准配置路径。"
msgstr ""
"Desktop and installer use Xorg/FLTK. Old windowd clients, service entries, and dedicated settings "
"cannot directly configure new sessions; use standard XDM/IceWM configuration paths."

msgid "镜像/启动集成删除独立 ``loader.elf`` 和 ``.drv`` 包装；自定义 GRUB、安装介质、更新脚本及产物收集清单必须同步，不能只替换一个旧启动文件。"
msgstr ""
"Image/boot integration removes separate ``loader.elf`` and ``.drv`` wrappers. Custom GRUB "
"configurations, installation media, update scripts, and artifact manifests must change together; "
"replacing one old boot file is insufficient."

msgid ""
"登录 shell 改为真实 Bash，旧 Bash 路径别名和自定义账户 shell 设置应检查；``/bin/sh`` 继续使用 ash，Bash 专有语法不能写入要求 POSIX sh "
"的脚本。"
msgstr ""
"Login shells change to real Bash; check old Bash-path aliases and custom account shells. "
"``/bin/sh`` remains ash; do not use Bash-only syntax in POSIX-sh scripts."

msgid "Fileman 是直接删除模式，不提供回收站；文件打开关联和默认终端发生变化。默认镜像不再包含 Doom/launcher，PCManFM 也不随本版交付。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman deletes directly without a trash bin. File associations and the default terminal change. "
"Default images no longer include Doom/launcher; PCManFM is also not delivered."

msgid "mbedTLS 主版本升级涉及开发 API/配置差异；依赖旧 2.x 头文件或链接库的移植软件需要重建和适配。"
msgstr ""
"The mbedTLS major upgrade changes development APIs/configuration; ports using old 2.x headers or "
"libraries need rebuilding and adaptation."

msgid ""
"新办公应用使用自身原生格式，并非 Microsoft Office 文件兼容替代。ReliefExcel 不支持 XLS/XLSX，ReliefWord 不支持 "
"DOC/DOCX，ReliefPPT 不支持 PPT/PPTX；格式导出也不保证保留全部原生编辑信息。"
msgstr ""
"New office applications use native formats and are not Microsoft Office-compatible replacements. "
"ReliefExcel does not support XLS/XLSX, ReliefWord DOC/DOCX, or ReliefPPT PPT/PPTX; exports do not "
"guarantee all native editing information is preserved."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and migration notes"

msgid "本次只提供源码。备份用户文件、账户数据、软件源、world 约束、系统配置及自定义启动文件；使用对应标签和子模块提交构建，不能把旧本机镜像视为本版安装介质。"
msgstr ""
"This release provides source only. Back up user files, account data, repositories, world "
"constraints, system configuration, and custom boot files. Build with the matching tag/submodule "
"commits; old local images are not installation media for this release."

msgid "现有安装的跨版本原地升级尚未完成整版验证。先在独立磁盘/虚拟机副本中验证自己的安装和升级流程；不要将历史局部成功理解为所有存量系统都能直接升级。"
msgstr ""
"Cross-version in-place upgrades of existing installations have not completed full-release "
"validation. Verify installation/upgrade workflows on separate disks or VM copies first; historical"
" partial successes do not imply all existing systems upgrade directly."

msgid ""
"切换桌面时核对 ``/etc/X11/xdm/``、``/usr/lib/X11/xdm/`` 和 IceWM 配置。用户个人主题/偏好优先于系统默认；纯控制台安装应检查所选 profile "
"的组件范围。"
msgstr ""
"When changing desktops, check ``/etc/X11/xdm/``, ``/usr/lib/X11/xdm/``, and IceWM configuration. "
"User themes/preferences override defaults; console-only installs should check selected-profile "
"component scope."

msgid ""
"官方 Bash 可用后再按需要使用 ``/usr/lib/reliefos/migrate-shell``；检查账户 shell、登录脚本和 ``/etc/shells``，保留有意使用其他 "
"shell 的账户设置。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``/usr/lib/reliefos/migrate-shell`` as needed only after official Bash is available. Check "
"account shells, login scripts, and ``/etc/shells`` while preserving accounts intentionally using "
"other shells."

msgid ""
"自定义引导或打包流程应同时更新内核、GRUB 和 rootfs 的对应内容，移除对 ``loader.elf``、``.drv``、旧桌面服务及旧包内容的假设。内核兼容性细节请另读对应 "
"ReliefNT Release。"
msgstr ""
"Custom boot/packaging workflows must update kernel, GRUB, and rootfs contents together and remove "
"assumptions about ``loader.elf``, ``.drv``, old desktop services, and old package contents. Read "
"the matching ReliefNT Release for kernel compatibility details."

msgid ""
"办公文件先保留原件，并保存到对应 ``.rexl``、``.rword``、``.rppt`` 格式；CSV/TXT/HTML/PNG 是特定用途的交换或分享格式。文件管理器删除前应自行确认备份。"
msgstr ""
"Keep office originals and save in matching ``.rexl``, ``.rword``, or ``.rppt`` formats. "
"CSV/TXT/HTML/PNG are purpose-specific exchange/sharing formats. Confirm backups yourself before "
"Fileman deletion."

msgid ""
"ReliefAPK 当前固定适配 apk-tools 3.0.8-r0；系统更新时保留软件源、信任密钥和本地配置。ReliefMail "
"尚需完成默认构建/镜像集成，不能作为升级后的默认邮件功能依赖。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefAPK currently targets apk-tools 3.0.8-r0; preserve repositories, trusted keys, and local "
"settings during updates. ReliefMail still needs default build/image integration and must not be "
"relied on as default mail functionality after upgrade."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid "主仓仅包含系统集成和用户态；递归初始化子模块，并使用本标签固定的内核 gitlink。不要将主仓 Release 正文当作内核更新清单。"
msgstr ""
"This repository contains only system integration and userspace. Initialize submodules recursively "
"and use this tag's pinned kernel gitlink; this Release body is not a kernel change list."

msgid ""
"生产入口为根 GNU Make；主仓与内核数字基础版本均为 ``5.1.0``。内核 ``EXTRAVERSION`` / ``LOCALVERSION`` 继续独立工作，数字版本宏为 "
"``5/1/0``。"
msgstr ""
"The production entry is root GNU Make. Both repositories' numeric base version is ``5.1.0``; "
"kernel ``EXTRAVERSION`` / ``LOCALVERSION`` remain independent, and numeric macros are ``5/1/0``."

msgid ""
"自有图形前端使用目标 musl、C++17、FLTK 及锁定的目标运行库；保留 ``-fno-exceptions -fno-rtti`` 和现有 C "
"后端边界。新应用需分别处理组件、构建、镜像、菜单、关联、翻译与运行验证。"
msgstr ""
"In-house graphical frontends use target musl, C++17, FLTK, and pinned target runtimes, preserving "
"``-fno-exceptions -fno-rtti`` and existing C-backend boundaries. New applications must separately "
"handle components, builds, images, menus, associations, translations, and runtime validation."

msgid "内核导出接口和相关夹具应消费正确子模块的头文件；不要修改 ABI golden 或音频 manifest 来掩盖不一致。性能脚本仅在声明的平台、场景和持久化语义内解释。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel-exported interfaces and fixtures must consume headers from the correct submodule. Do not "
"change ABI golden data or audio manifests to hide inconsistencies. Interpret performance scripts "
"only within their declared platforms, scenarios, and persistence semantics."

msgid ""
"发布时遵循 `发布规范 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__，下一版范围从本次 "
"``5.1.0`` 版本提交之后重新计算，仍分别编写两仓说明。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the `release policy "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__. The next "
"range starts after this ``5.1.0`` version commit; continue writing separate notes for both "
"repositories."

msgid "验证与已知限制"
msgstr "Validation and known limitations"

msgid "本次发布执行了以下检查，结果分别披露："
msgstr "The following checks were performed for this release, with results disclosed separately:"

msgid ""
"**编译通过**：``TMPDIR=\"$PWD/out/tmp\" make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 build-info "
"kernel``。主仓和子构建生成的版本字符串均为 ``5.1.0``，数字宏均为 ``5/1/0``。这是主仓版本及内核构建适配检查，没有重新打包本版系统镜像。"
msgstr ""
"**Compilation passed:** ``TMPDIR=\"$PWD/out/tmp\" make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 "
"build-info kernel``. Both parent/subbuild version strings were ``5.1.0`` and numeric macros "
"``5/1/0``. This checks repository versioning and kernel-build adaptation; system images were not "
"repackaged."

msgid ""
"**定向检查通过**：主仓宿主工具（含 ASan/UBSan）、版本 ABI、内核版本/后缀/无操作重建/非法后缀拒绝/父仓适配/procfs 夹具、RPR 包命名与信任密钥契约；完整检查命令为 "
"``make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 test-tools`` 以及 ``sh tests/build/test-version-"
"abi.sh``、``sh tests/build/test-kernel-version.sh``、``sh tests/build/test-rpr-packages.sh``，均使用主仓 "
"``out/tmp``。"
msgstr ""
"**Targeted checks passed:** host tools (including ASan/UBSan), version ABI, kernel "
"version/suffix/no-op rebuild/invalid-suffix rejection/parent adaptation/procfs fixtures, and RPR "
"naming/trust-key contracts. Full commands were ``make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 "
"test-tools``, ``sh tests/build/test-version-abi.sh``, ``sh tests/build/test-kernel-version.sh``, "
"and ``sh tests/build/test-rpr-packages.sh``, all using this repository's ``out/tmp``."

msgid ""
"**主仓完整门禁未通过**：``make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 test build-info`` 在音频包检查停止，默认 "
"``out/audio-hda`` 中缺少 ``libreliefos-audio.so.1``。未把后续未执行用例算作通过，也未改动音频 manifest。"
msgstr ""
"**Full repository gate failed:** ``make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 test build-"
"info`` stopped at audio-package checks because default ``out/audio-hda`` lacked ``libreliefos-"
"audio.so.1``. Subsequent unrun cases were not counted as passed; the audio manifest was unchanged."

msgid ""
"**品牌门禁未通过**：``sh tests/build/test-brand-identity.sh`` 的版本身份检查通过，但四个应用 QEMU 测试脚本仍引用既有翻译域文件、未登记品牌 "
"allowlist，产生四项旧名门禁失败。本次未改写这些历史兼容路径或放宽门禁。"
msgstr ""
"**Brand gate failed:** version-identity checks in ``sh tests/build/test-brand-identity.sh`` "
"passed, but four application QEMU scripts reference existing translation-domain files absent from "
"the brand allowlist, causing four old-name failures. Historical compatibility paths were not "
"rewritten and gates were not relaxed."

msgid ""
"**Pages 门禁未通过**：``sh tests/build/test-pages.sh`` 检出历史 ReliefWord 本机截图链接和 vDSO 内部设计记录链接在生成站点中断开；RPR"
" 元数据检查通过，不代表整棵站点可以部署。"
msgstr ""
"**Pages gate failed:** ``sh tests/build/test-pages.sh`` found broken historical ReliefWord local-"
"screenshot and vDSO internal-design links in generated pages. RPR metadata checks passed, but that"
" does not make the whole site deployable."

msgid "上述失败均定位到本次版本/规则修改之外的既有输入或环境要求；本 Release 保留失败记录，不以源码发布替代这些门禁。"
msgstr ""
"These failures were traced to existing inputs or environment requirements outside this "
"version/rule change. This Release preserves them; publishing source does not substitute for those "
"gates."

msgid "VMware 验证未完成；真实硬件运行未验证。"
msgstr "VMware validation is incomplete; physical-hardware operation is unverified."

msgid ""
"历史 GUI/办公应用/包管理器 QEMU 证据只覆盖其各自记录的程序、镜像和步骤。FLTK 完整新装 E2E 曾在复制阶段超时，标准 VGA "
"显示问题仍有未决记录；本次源码发布没有重新宣称这些项目通过。"
msgstr ""
"Historical GUI/office/package-manager QEMU evidence covers only its recorded programs, images, and"
" steps. Full FLTK fresh-install E2E previously timed out during copying, and standard-VGA display "
"issues remain open. This source release does not newly claim those items passed."

msgid "本版未上传 VMDK、ISO、Installer ISO、SDK 或内核二进制，也没有把旧镜像重标为 5.1.0。"
msgstr ""
"No VMDK, ISO, Installer ISO, SDK, or kernel binaries were uploaded, and old images were not "
"relabeled as 5.1.0."

msgid "ReliefMail 默认构建/组件/镜像集成未完成；办公应用的格式与功能限制见各自文档。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefMail default build/component/image integration is incomplete. See each office application's "
"documentation for format and feature limits."

msgid "获取与追溯"
msgstr "Downloads and traceability"

msgid ""
"本仓 `v5.1.0 源码 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/tree/v5.1.0>`__ 及 GitHub 自动生成的 Source "
"code 归档；自动源码归档不包含展开后的子模块源码，需要完整构建输入时应克隆并执行 ``git submodule update --init --recursive``。"
msgstr ""
"Use this repository's `v5.1.0 source <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/tree/v5.1.0>`__ "
"or GitHub-generated Source code archives. Automatic archives do not expand submodules; for "
"complete build inputs, clone and run ``git submodule update --init --recursive``."

msgid ""
"`完整提交与差异 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/compare/6894edc64ba663193ec9139732e704f93b0d0b24...v5.1.0>`__。链接包含完整"
" Git 历史；本说明已排除纯内核指针和机械版本条目。"
msgstr ""
"`Full commits and diff "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/compare/6894edc64ba663193ec9139732e704f93b0d0b24...v5.1.0>`__."
" The link includes full Git history; these notes exclude kernel-pointer-only and mechanical "
"version entries."

msgid ""
"`构建说明 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/BUILDSYSTEM.md>`__、`Xorg 桌面 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/XORG.md>`__、`FLTK 验证记录 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/FLTK_APPS_VALIDATION.md>`__、`ReliefExcel"
" <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELIEFEXCEL.md>`__、`ReliefWord "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELIEFWORD.md>`__、`ReliefPPT "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELIEFPPT.md>`__、`音频 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/AUDIO.md>`__。"
msgstr ""
"`Build instructions "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/BUILDSYSTEM.md>`__, `Xorg desktop "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/XORG.md>`__, `FLTK validation "
"records <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/FLTK_APPS_VALIDATION.md>`__,"
" `ReliefExcel <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELIEFEXCEL.md>`__, "
"`ReliefWord <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELIEFWORD.md>`__, "
"`ReliefPPT <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/RELIEFPPT.md>`__, `Audio "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.0/docs/AUDIO.md>`__."
